<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84000" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῠν-ός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trough, tank,</i> or <i>pit, in
				which dirty clothes were washed</i> by treading, pl., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.40
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				86
			</span></i>; pl., <i>washing-places,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ephor.
				1J.
			</span></i>; later <i>washing-tubs, fuller's tubs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Fug.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				46.4
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> parox. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύνος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>washing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νιτρικῆς πλύνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
					 i126
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.114
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύνον
				ποιεῖν τινα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλύνω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1061
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πλύνεσθαι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑβρίζεσθαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.101
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
